# The model the red team's attacker and scorers run on: the same weights as the
# pinned model, with the context the agent under test uses.
#
#   ollama create qwen3.8-redteam:27b -f server/redteam/Modelfile
#
# PyRIT reaches Ollama through its OpenAI-compatible API, which ignores
# options.num_ctx and uses the Modelfile's value. The pinned model says 100000 and
# the agent sends 16384, and Ollama reloads a runner when the context changes, so
# without this every switch between attacker and defender spends 6 to 12 seconds on
# a reload. Set REDTEAM_MODEL=qwen3.8-redteam:27b so both sides share one runner.
FROM qwen3.8:27b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
